  "description": "Fed up with office politics, a cold-tempered team leader decides to quit after years of frustration. However, his irritating junior colleague, who has spent four years constantly bickering with him, becomes responsible for his final handover. As they spend long nights working together during his last month, the younger man unexpectedly confesses his feelings and makes a bold request. Now, as retirement approaches, their relationship is about to begin a whole new chapter.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4447000715), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/last_task), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000083753), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=260883)",
